{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-3-1","title":"Psalms 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The security of God's protection.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2983. B.C. 1021. (Title.)Psalm, {Mizmor,} from the verb to cut, prune, sing, a poem cut into short sentences, divided into syllables, pruned from every redundancy, and thus adapted for singing.</p>\n<p>when. 2Sa 15:1-18:33 how. 2Sa 15:12; 16:15; 17:11-13; Mt 27:25 many. 17:7; Mt 10:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-3-2","title":"Psalms 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>no. 22:7; 42:3,10; 71:11; 2Sa 16:7,8; Mt 27:42,43 Selah. 4,8; 4:2,4; Hab 3:3,9,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-3-3","title":"Psalms 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>a shield. 18:2; 28:7; 84:11; 119:114; Ge 15:1; De 33:29 for. or, about. my. 4:3; 62:7; Isa 45:25; 60:19; Lu 2:32; Re 21:11,23 the. 27:6; 110:7; Ge 40:13; 2Ki 25:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-3-4","title":"Psalms 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>I cried. 22:2-5; 34:6; 50:15; 66:17-19; 86:3,4; 91:15; 116:1-4; 130:1,2; 138:3 142:1-3; Isa 65:24; Jer 29:12,13; Mt 7:7; Jas 5:13 he. 34:4 his. 2:6; 43:3; 99:9; 132:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-3-5","title":"Psalms 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>I laid. 4:8; 127:2; Le 26:6; Job 11:18,19; Pr 3:24; Ac 12:6 the. 4:8; 66:9; Pr 14:26; 18:10; Isa 26:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-3-6","title":"Psalms 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>I will. 27:1-3; 46:2,7; 118:10-12; 2Ki 6:15-17; Ro 8:31 ten. 2Sa 18:7 set. 2:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-3-7","title":"Psalms 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Arise. 10:12; 12:5; 35:23; 44:23; 59:5; 74:11; 76:9; Isa 51:9; Hab 2:19 thou. 58:6; Job 16:10; 29:17; La 3:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-3-8","title":"Psalms 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Salvation. 37:39,40; Pr 21:31; Isa 43:11; 45:21,22; Jer 3:23; Ho 13:4; Jon 2:9 Ac 4:12; Re 7:10; 19:1 thy blessing. 29:11; 72:17; Ac 3:26; Eph 1:3; Heb 6:14; 1Pe 3:9</p>"}]}